# feh keys: only overrides live here, defaults stay for everything else.
# A line replaces ALL default keys of its action (3 keys max), and a bare
# action unbinds it. n/p and the keypad zoom keys fall off the end here.

# vim-style browsing; h was toggle_pause, which moves to P
next_img space Right l
prev_img BackSpace Left h
toggle_pause P

# zoom on plain +/=/- (they shipped bound to reload-delay tweaking)
zoom_in Up plus equal
zoom_out Down minus
reload_plus
reload_minus
